---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import FactTile from '../../components/FactTile.astro';
---
<Base title="How we check" description="What confirmed, business says and not confirmed mean on Find Me CBR.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>How we check</h1>
    <p>Every place shows the date we last checked it. Each fact says how we know it:</p>
    <ul class="fact-tiles">
      <FactTile fact={{ label: 'Step-free entry', evidence: 'confirmed', icon: 'accessibility' }} />
      <FactTile fact={{ label: 'Step-free entry', evidence: 'business_says', icon: 'accessibility' }} />
      <FactTile fact={{ label: 'Step-free entry', evidence: 'unknown', icon: 'accessibility' }} />
    </ul>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Confirmed:</strong> we saw it ourselves, or tested it in person.</li>
      <li><strong>Business says:</strong> the business told us, or it's on their own website.</li>
      <li><strong>Not confirmed:</strong> we don't know yet. We never guess.</li>
      <li><strong>Our take:</strong> our opinion, clearly marked. It's never paid for, and we don't give opinions on health services.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>A service, such as a cleaner or electrician, only appears for a suburb they've told us they cover. Where they're based doesn't count.</p>
    <p>Sponsored places are labelled, appear at most once in the first five results, and still have to match everything you searched for.</p>
  </div>
  <a class="rowtile" href="/report/"><span><Icon name="flag" class="lead" /><span>Spotted something wrong?<small>Tell us and we'll check it</small></span></span><Icon name="chevron-right" /></a>
</Base>
